00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Jeez.</font>

32
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Pervy Sage!</font>

33
00:01:57,590 --> 00:02:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you going to
watch my training?!</font>

34
00:02:00,550 --> 00:02:02,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm researching now.</font>

35
00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it yourself!</font>

36
00:02:05,890 --> 00:02:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, then I'll summon a frog,
a frog so big you'll be shocked!</font>

37
00:02:13,730 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Summoning Jutsu!</font>

38
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm? What's wrong?
Did a frog appear?</font>

39
00:02:24,990 --> 00:02:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait a minute!</font>

40
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What part of that's a frog?!</font>

41
00:02:30,290 --> 00:02:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't get serious,
I won't help you!</font>

42
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I am being serious!</font>

43
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then somehow find your Chakra
as if your life depended on it!</font>

44
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I'm doing!</font>

45
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

46
00:03:27,590 --> 00:03:28,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

47
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura!</font>

48
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

49
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time you wake up
and help me over here!</font>

50
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not sleeping!
I'm busy right now!</font>

51
00:03:38,110 --> 00:03:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes...
Then when won't you be busy?</font>

52
00:03:41,990 --> 00:03:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Later!</font>

53
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe it... Jeez!</font>

54
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Painful Feeling,</font>

55
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Single Flower</font>

56
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">with a Wish In It</font>

57
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some of you have probably
already heard but...</font>

58
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gekko Hayate's corpse was
found near Kikyo Castle...</font>

59
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... Hayate?</font>

60
00:04:12,270 --> 00:04:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

61
00:04:13,770 --> 00:04:14,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's ridiculous!</font>

62
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is the opponent Orochimaru?</font>

63
00:04:18,110 --> 00:04:21,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... we shouldn't jump to
that conclusion so easily.</font>

64
00:04:22,110 --> 00:04:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one Hayate was following
was likely a Sound spy called Kabuto...</font>

65
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's certain that Orochimaru
is trying to do something but...</font>

66
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... we'll cancel Chunin Exams
and go after Orochimaru...?!</font>

67
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, he revealed his identity to Anko...</font>

68
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">sending us a threat not to cancel.</font>

69
00:04:41,590 --> 00:04:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not to cancel the Chunin Exam</font>

70
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for which all of the Ninja of
the Alliance have gathered!</font>

71
00:04:47,140 --> 00:04:48,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does it mean?</font>

72
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru possesses enough power
to take down a small Land on his own.</font>

73
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a Shinobi that probably
every land has eyes on.</font>

74
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, he conveniently holds
a grudge</font>

75
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">against this Village Hidden
in the Leaves.</font>

76
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any Land would desire him.</font>

77
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So could it be...</font>

78
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that any Land in the Alliance
would unite with Orochimaru</font>

79
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and betray the Village Hidden
in the Leaves?!</font>

80
00:05:15,790 --> 00:05:20,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the Alliance Treaty is at
the same level as a verbal agreement!</font>

81
00:05:22,590 --> 00:05:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As was in the former Great Ninja War...</font>

82
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,</font>

83
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:31,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's too little information
right now.</font>

84
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's end these unnecessary
suspicions.</font>

85
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've already dispatched ANBU,</font>

86
00:05:35,890 --> 00:05:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the black ops to each Land
to collect information.</font>

87
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dangerous to act carelessly...</font>

88
00:05:41,190 --> 00:05:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That could be what the enemy
is aiming for.</font>

89
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also...</font>

90
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:56,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I trust all of you!</font>

91
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the time comes,</font>

92
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:08,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll bring all the powers of Hidden Leaf
Village together and simply fight!</font>

93
00:06:33,990 --> 00:06:34,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time...</font>

94
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet about this bruise!</font>

95
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I have stopped him forcefully...?</font>

96
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No visitors...?</font>

97
00:06:55,890 --> 00:06:58,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's correct.
I'm sorry but...</font>

98
00:06:58,230 --> 00:07:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know he's been hospitalized,
but no visitors...?!</font>

99
00:07:01,770 --> 00:07:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

100
00:07:03,230 --> 00:07:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're also not aware of the details so...</font>

101
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:14,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no use worrying about it here.</font>

102
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

103
00:07:26,170 --> 00:07:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I bring get-well flowers?</font>

104
00:07:32,590 --> 00:07:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So pretty.</font>

105
00:07:38,350 --> 00:07:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

106
00:07:39,730 --> 00:07:45,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... How unusual for you to come
by to buy our flowers.</font>

107
00:07:45,610 --> 00:07:48,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Not really!
Why would you care?</font>

108
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, isn't it unusual that
you're minding the shop?</font>

109
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll choose quickly.</font>

110
00:07:55,910 --> 00:07:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People don't like flowers with
roots when they're in the hospital</font>

111
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:00,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since they don't want to
be "rooted" in the hospital...</font>

112
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So cut flowers are fundamental.</font>

113
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:05,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you talking about...?</font>

114
00:08:06,290 --> 00:08:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Playing dumb won't work.</font>

115
00:08:08,090 --> 00:08:10,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to see Sasuke-kun, right?</font>

116
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:15,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom! I'm going out for a bit!</font>

117
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-Ino?!</font>

118
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you be the first to visit!
I'm going with you!</font>

119
00:08:22,690 --> 00:08:24,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A get-well visit!</font>

120
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:28,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...Ino Pig!</font>

121
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm taking this flower...</font>

122
00:08:33,070 --> 00:08:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One "rose" of love!</font>

123
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's so cliché...</font>

124
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:41,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll make mine this.
"Narcissus"!</font>

125
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A noble flower that doesn't
succumb to the cold of the winter,</font>

126
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but hopes for the spring and
waits with dignified presence...</font>

127
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the wish for release from
the hospital as soon as possible.</font>

128
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:55,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've gotten pretty knowledgeable.</font>

129
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you I wouldn't lose to you!</font>

130
00:08:57,090 --> 00:09:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yes yes, so one narcissus, right?</font>

131
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... I need two.</font>

132
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? One is fine.</font>

133
00:09:05,190 --> 00:09:07,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... One for Lee-san too.</font>

134
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More please!</font>

135
00:09:21,950 --> 00:09:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— Huh?</font>

136
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ten orders of BBQ beef!</font>

137
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure can eat.
Just watching you makes me feel ill.</font>

138
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:36,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are!</font>

139
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:38,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's here!</font>

140
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is mine, all right?
Don't eat any of it, Shikamaru!</font>

141
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't eat any!</font>

142
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on with you guys,
barbecue in the middle of the day?</font>

143
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh...?
— Huh?</font>

144
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino and Sakura...</font>

145
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, shouldn't you be going through
some special training or something</font>

146
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to prepare for the final exam?</font>

147
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:00,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am...</font>

148
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every single day...</font>

149
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma is so persistent.</font>

150
00:10:06,910 --> 00:10:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, Choji's been joining us
in the special training.</font>

151
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

152
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you took it on?</font>

153
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup! In exchange, he's treating me
to as much barbecue as I can eat!</font>

154
00:10:20,010 --> 00:10:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

155
00:10:21,970 --> 00:10:26,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I shouldn't have held on
for the Final Round.</font>

156
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be ridiculous!</font>

157
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are numerous people who
want to participate, but can't!</font>

158
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

159
00:10:32,690 --> 00:10:33,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From what I've heard,</font>

160
00:10:33,610 --> 00:10:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're doing some awfully
difficult things</font>

161
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">over at Guy and Kurenai's team!</font>

162
00:10:37,780 --> 00:10:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's that?</font>

163
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we've made
it this far,</font>

164
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to get totally thrashed
wouldn't be very cool...</font>

165
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw man, what a drag...</font>

166
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever the circumstances,</font>

167
00:11:01,970 --> 00:11:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we've exceeded
a human being's limits.</font>

168
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I've used too much Chakra...</font>

169
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:09,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, are you all right?!</font>

170
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

171
00:11:51,890 --> 00:11:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! A tadpole again?!</font>

172
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You haven't made
any progress whatsoever!</font>

173
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See how it's bigger
than the ones earlier?!</font>

174
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:01,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How the hell should I know?!</font>

175
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you want to see
Uchiha Sasuke-san...?</font>

176
00:12:14,750 --> 00:12:15,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just five minutes.</font>

177
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't allow you to visit
any longer than that.</font>

178
00:12:19,590 --> 00:12:22,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His body still needs to rest...</font>

179
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

180
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun. You have visitors...</font>

181
00:12:27,970 --> 00:12:29,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two cute young ladies...</font>

182
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...!</font>

183
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

184
00:12:33,350 --> 00:12:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, Sasuke-kun?</font>

185
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His clothes are gone!</font>

186
00:12:39,530 --> 00:12:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?</font>

187
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's terrible! He's in no condition
to be walking outside yet!</font>

188
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doctor! Doctor!</font>

189
00:12:47,450 --> 00:12:48,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

190
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

191
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun will, without
a doubt, desire me...</font>

192
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Where in the world
have you gone...?</font>

193
00:13:21,650 --> 00:13:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could cliff-climbing be so taxing...?</font>

194
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, my body is sluggish...</font>

195
00:13:29,660 --> 00:13:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will I make it in time...?</font>

196
00:13:53,140 --> 00:13:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open!</font>

197
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

198
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo!</font>

199
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... You finally made it here...</font>

200
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll search for Sasuke-kun
on our end.</font>

201
00:14:28,050 --> 00:14:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you happen to see him,
please contact us.</font>

202
00:14:32,050 --> 00:14:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— We will.
— Yes.</font>

203
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also... you wanted to see Lee-kun, right?</font>

204
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes.
— Yes.</font>

205
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's also in no condition to move,
so please make your visit brief.</font>

206
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-kun, you have visitors.</font>

207
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two cute young ladies...</font>

208
00:14:48,650 --> 00:14:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?!</font>

209
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— Huh?!</font>

210
00:14:51,370 --> 00:14:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really... even Lee-kun!</font>

211
00:14:54,030 --> 00:14:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-kun! Lee-kun!</font>

212
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san...</font>

213
00:14:57,450 --> 00:14:58,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

214
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Look!
— Huh?</font>

215
00:15:04,380 --> 00:15:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-kun...?!</font>

216
00:15:07,050 --> 00:15:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, let's go!</font>

217
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

218
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">200 one-armed push-ups...</font>

219
00:15:15,970 --> 00:15:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't do them,
100 one-legged squats...</font>

220
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">190...!</font>

221
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:33,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-kun! Stop it!
Lee-kun! Stop it!</font>

222
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">191...</font>

223
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-kun!</font>

224
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't touch me!</font>

225
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... interfere...
with my training...</font>

226
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need two...</font>

227
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:53,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? One is fine.</font>

228
00:15:54,050 --> 00:15:56,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... One for Lee-san too...</font>

229
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speaking of which, Sakura,
did you hear about that Lee-san?</font>

230
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:07,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Hear what?</font>

231
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that Lee-san...</font>

232
00:16:11,070 --> 00:16:15,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his injuries were serious and
he can no longer...</font>

233
00:16:15,490 --> 00:16:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">continue as a Shinobi.</font>

234
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:24,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">195...</font>

235
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">196...</font>

236
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">197...</font>

237
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">198...</font>

238
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:48,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... not finished... yet!</font>

239
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no value in making
an effort for someone</font>

240
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who doesn't believe in himself!</font>

241
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One... one hundred... ninety... nine...</font>

242
00:17:19,850 --> 00:17:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One... One more...</font>

243
00:17:24,980 --> 00:17:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more time...!</font>

244
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— Oh!</font>

245
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san...!</font>

246
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll... go get the stretcher.</font>

247
00:17:43,450 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please keep an eye on him.</font>

248
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:45,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

249
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:04,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Ino...</font>

250
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

251
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do boys...
have to push themselves?</font>

252
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't ask me that.
I'm a girl you know!</font>

253
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry...</font>

254
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Human... Boulder!</font>

255
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Shadow Possession Ju...!</font>

256
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it, I don't have enough Chakra!</font>

257
00:18:47,310 --> 00:18:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Shikamaru?!</font>

258
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you hit your limit already?</font>

259
00:18:50,770 --> 00:18:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! What a drag...</font>

260
00:18:53,770 --> 00:18:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, Choji!
One more time!</font>

261
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who brought that...?</font>

262
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:30,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rose I went to the trouble
of bringing was a waste.</font>

263
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My narcissus too...</font>

264
00:19:36,780 --> 00:19:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... How boring.</font>

265
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

266
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The swimsuit gals have gone,
so why don't we call it a day?</font>

267
00:19:45,450 --> 00:19:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Let's stay a little longer!</font>

268
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, a little longer...
Just a little longer!</font>

269
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry. And I'm pretty tired too.</font>

270
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You haven't even done anything.</font>

271
00:19:56,290 --> 00:19:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should be thankful
I hung out with you!</font>

272
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's getting ticked off at me.</font>

273
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:06,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I got it... Sexy Jutsu!</font>

274
00:20:12,230 --> 00:20:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

275
00:20:18,190 --> 00:20:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, that's it?</font>

276
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:25,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I want to do isn't the Sexy Jutsu,
but Summoning Jutsu!</font>

277
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, all right...
Then try it out.</font>

278
00:20:29,370 --> 00:20:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here goes...!</font>

279
00:20:32,710 --> 00:20:34,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning... Jutsu!</font>

280
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

281
00:20:39,090 --> 00:20:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should die!
You have no talent!</font>

282
00:20:42,090 --> 00:20:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take a careful look!</font>

283
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

284
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See, it has rear legs!</font>

285
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot! Conjure one up with
hands, feet and ears!</font>

286
00:20:57,940 --> 00:21:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut your mouth!
Having legs is better than before!</font>

287
00:21:13,470 --> 00:21:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="20"><b><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f2cd97">ONE JAMPU ichiban SURAMU DANKU kamasu TAISON</font></font></b></font></font>

288
