<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="20"><b><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#0c6643">One! first, Tyson jumps and slam-dunks</font></font></b></font></font>

289
00:21:16,810 --> 00:21:20,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="20"><b><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f2cd97">TWO are mo kore mo dosoku de HAGU KISSU I LOVE YOU</font></font></b></font></font>

