00:21:20,270 --> 00:21:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="20"><b><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f2cd97">THREE YOGA wo kiwamemasu KAREE kirai masara san</font></font></b></font></font>

292
00:21:20,270 --> 00:21:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="20"><b><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#0c6643">Three! Masala masters yoga but hates curry</font></font></b></font></font>

293
00:21:23,730 --> 00:21:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="20"><b><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f2cd97">FOUR hetare tougyuushi SANCHESU OREI</font></font></b></font></font>

294
